# Minimal X11 stack for the MRG5 framebuffer console test (Debian 12 armhf).
# X on /dev/fb0 through the fbdev driver, libinput for USB keyboard/mouse,
# xinit to start it, one tiny window manager and xterm to have something to see.
xserver-xorg-core
xserver-xorg-video-fbdev
xserver-xorg-input-libinput
xinit
xterm
twm
